"L0f8323da7a" = "I-vibrato iwukuphusha intambo kancane uyidedele, uphindaphinda ngokushesha enothini elibanjwe lide. Yenza ukunyakaza kube kuncane futhi kulingane ukuze inothi lihlale lishunile.";
