"L594cfc45fd" = "U-Henry Bishop wabhala lo mculo we-opera yaseLondon ngo-1823, ngamazwi omlingisi waseMelika u-John Howard Payne. Eminyakeni embalwa nje waba ngenye yezingoma ezazithandwa kakhulu emhlabeni.";
"L5952f9b6a9" = "U-Phillips Brooks wabhala la mazwi ngo-1868 ewenzela izingane zesonto lakhe lasePhiladelphia, umdlali walo we-ogani, u-Lewis Redner, wabhala umculo wenkonzo yabo kaKhisimusi.";
"L597b60da13" = "Khuphukela ku-C, wehle ku-B ovulekile ubuye, bese D, wehle ku-A, no-D futhi.";
