"L8afae1aebf" = "U-Reginald Heber wabhala la mazwi, ashicilelwa ngo-1826, u-John Bacchus Dykes wabhala umculo ngo-1861. Umugqa wokuqala ukhuphuka ngamanothi e-chord ka-G major.";
