"L8b5cbd551a" = "I-roll eya phambili ihamba ngendlela eyodwa: isithupha, owokukhomba, ophakathi, njalo njalo. Amanothi ayisishiyagalombili enza lokhu kabili, bese isithupha nowokukhomba.";
