"L8c00bae676" = "U-B7 usekelwe ohlamvini lwesihlanu uma ubala usuka ku-E. Olwesihlanu usuka ku-A ngu-E, ngakho u-E7 uthatha indawo yawo.";
"L8c1a14f104" = "I-interval yibanga phakathi kwamanothi amabili. Yeqa isinyathelo esisodwa se-scale uthole i-interval yesithathu, njengo-do kuya ku-mi. Yizwa u-mi engqondweni ngaphambi kokushiya u-do.";
"L8c1ce802ec" = "Ukuhlelwa kwengoma kunquma ukuthi udlala ini, nini. Okwakho: isingeniso ngendlela ka-Travis, ivesi njengomculo wamanothi, ikhorasi nge-boom-chick, bese umculo wamanothi ekhorasi uphetha.";
"L8c21826a55" = "Kugcina izintambo zishunile";
