"Leeafc98b67" = "Umugqa webhesi ehambayo udlala inothi elisha esigqini ngasinye. Qala ngesisekelo, elesithathu, elesihlanu, elesithupha: ku-A kuba A, C ophakanyisiwe, E, F ophakanyisiwe.";
