"Leef76bf0e0" = "I-interval igcina igama layo noma ikhuphuka noma yehla. Ukwehla kusuka ku-G kuya ku-C kuseyi-interval yesihlanu. Lalela ubukhulu bebanga, hhayi indlela eya kuyo.";
