"Lf026eac482" = "Lo mculo wendabuko ugxuma usuka ku-C ukhuphukele ku-G, bese wehla ngenothi ngalinye. Umugqa ngamunye uphela ngenothi elide.";
"Lf02792e9e5" = "Shaya izintambo kanye, bese usebenzisa ibha esele ukushintsha. Zama ukufika ku-chord entsha ngqo esigqini sokuqala. Ijubane lizozifikela kamuva.";
"Lf0292a943f" = "U-A kuya ku-C uyi-interval yesithathu eyi-minor, ohhafu bethoni abathathu.";
