"Lf0714231ef" = "Hlala eduze konqenqema olungaphambili lwesihlalo, izinyawo zisicaba phansi, amadolo ahlukene, kube sengathi ungavuka kalula. I-cello ihlala phakathi kwamadolo.";
"Lf0914244f3" = "Luye ngapha nangapha";
"Lf09abc15d8" = "Izisekelo namanothi esihlanu, njengoba umdlali webhesi eqala ukuphelezela ibhendi: isisekelo se-chord lapho iqala, elesihlanu phakathi, ngamanothi aphansi endaweni yokuqala. Ingoma ihlala ku-D minor, lapho ibhendi iyidlala khona.";
"Lf0baa74e41" = "Ukuthula emhlabeni";
"Lf0bbc1d6e7" = "Ukushintsha izintambo, shintsha ukuphakama ngendololwane, hhayi ngesihlakala. Fika ekuphakameni okusha ngaphambi nje kokuba umnsalo ushintshe indlela.";
"Lf0db57fe3e" = "Ama-semiquaver";
"Lf0e20b63de" = "Phansi ku-1, phansi-phezulu ku-2, phansi ku-3, phansi-phezulu ku-4. Isandla sisakhuphuka ngemva kuka-1 no-3; simane singazithinti izintambo.";
"Lf0f611c748" = "Uphi u-A ophakanyisiwe entanjeni 5?";
"Lf0f7458ee6" = "Awukakulungeli ukwenza i-barre? Dlala izintambo ezine eziphezulu kuphela: i-fret 4 ezintanjeni 4 no-3, i-fret 3 entanjeni 2, i-fret 2 entanjeni 1.";
"Lf0fd6576f2" = "Au clair, ingxenye yesibili";
