"Lf115cd0d4d" = "I-hammer-on ikhalisa inothi lesibili ngesandla esicindezelayo sodwa. Ncinza inothi, bese wehlisa omunye umunwe ngokushesha nangokuqinile ngemuva nje kwe-fret ephakeme. Intambo iqhubeka ikhale.";
"Lf11be4708d" = "I-Greensleeves yayisiculwa eNgilandi ngeminyaka yawo-1580, futhi u-Shakespeare uyayisho ku-The Merry Wives of Windsor. Lapha iku-E minor, iphansi futhi ifiphele.";
"Lf149dab787" = "Hlala, ulungise i-endpin esekelayo, ubambe umnsalo, udlale izintambo ezivulekile nengoma yakho yokuqala.";
