"Lfd652e2b2f" = "Ungalokothi; yelula esikhundleni salokho";
"Lfd68d2b242" = "Ku-C major, iyiphi i-chord engu-IV?";
"Lfd6c77f4eb" = "Izinyathelo zizwakala zishelela; ukweqa kuyagqama. Uma uzwa ukugxuma, hlola ukuthi kufika enothini le-chord yasekhaya yini: do, mi noma sol.";
"Lfd7f26a962" = "Esigqini 4, dlala inothi eliqhele nge-fret eyodwa esisekelweni esilandelayo. Lidonsela ukulalela phambili, ukushintsha kuzwakale sengathi kufikile lapho bekulindelwe khona.";
