"Lfeddc76ee1" = "Abadlali be-cello banika umunwe ngamunye uhhafu wethoni, ngakho u-F udlalwa ngowesibili, u-F ophakanyisiwe ngowesithathu. Inothi elingaphezu kwesandla, njengo-F ophakanyisiwe ku-C, lidinga ukwelula isandla. Lesi sifundo sikhetha okhiye abakugwemayo.";
